# 7. Best stack по зрелости

## LTS / надёжный минимум

| Уровень     | Инструмент                 |
| ----------- | -------------------------- |
| State       | taxonomy classification    |
| State       | valence/arousal/intensity  |
| State space | clustering                 |
| Time        | transition matrix          |
| Pattern     | frequent pattern mining    |
| Graph       | centrality/path frequency  |
| Quality     | confidence + evidence refs |

Это самый крепкий стек.

```text
LTS stack =
taxonomy + scoring + clustering + transitions + motifs
```

