# 10. Сухой вывод

Лучшие инструменты под твою концепцию:

```text
STATE:
taxonomy + intensity + valence/arousal + embeddings

SPACE:
clustering + similarity search + density/outliers

SPACE + TIME:
transition matrix + sequence mining + trajectory comparison

GRAPH:
centrality + motifs + path frequency + communities

PATTERN:
loop detection + reinforcement mapping + recurrent signatures

SOTA later:
trajectory embeddings + temporal graph + KG embeddings + attractor analysis
```

Самый правильный MVP-стек:

```text
taxonomy
→ state_vector
→ transition_edges
→ loop_signature
→ recurrent_pattern
```

Это даст максимум аналитики без перегруза.
